Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SATM builds on the following upstream work. Each retains its own licence, and
nothing here relicenses it. Attributions are added to this file as components
are vendored into the tree.

1. Google SAM ("Sovereign Agent Mesh")
   https://github.com/google/sam
   Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

   Consumed unforked, through documented HTTP endpoints and sam-node.yaml
   configuration only. No SAM source is vendored into this repository.
   Note: upstream states it "is not an officially supported Google product."

2. ERC-8004 Trustless Agents reference contracts
   https://github.com/erc-8004/erc-8004-contracts
   Released under CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication).

   Planned to be vendored at a pinned commit under contracts/vendor/erc8004/,
   with the upstream CC0 notice retained. See
   docs/adr/0004-foundry-with-vendored-registries.md.

3. ERC-8004 and ERC-8226 specification text
   https://ercs.ethereum.org/ERCS/erc-8004
   https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-8226
   Copyright and related rights waived via CC0 1.0 Universal.

   Interface definitions are reproduced from the specification text. ERC-8226
   is a Draft EIP with no public reference implementation; SATM implements it
   from the specification and marks its own additions explicitly.
